### 1. Task outcome (short version):
Successfully completed quality assessment and synthesis of evidence from 1 included study (CHAP trial) for the 
cotrimoxazole prophylaxis systematic review. Key findings: Cotrimoxazole prophylaxis significantly reduces mortality (HR
